# Do not upload to GitHub unless asked

Do not commit, push, open a pull request, or otherwise upload this project to GitHub unless the user explicitly asks to upload, commit, or push.

Local edits, installs, and tests stay local. A Cloud Run or production fix is not permission to push.

```text
User: 维修照片没有进桶
❌ git add / git commit / git push
✅ Change the code locally and say it has not been uploaded
```
